    "Name": "Night Chanter Prime",
    "Details": "The Primary loadout of the Night Chanter is a combination of pulse and extended range lasers, making the 'Mech somewhat able to deal damage at most ranges. The varied loadout does mean it lacks the weapon profile to excel at any particular range, but the idea of the design is that any intended engagement does not occur within only a limited amount of ranges, and instead it is a constant flow back and forth.\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Quirk: Easy to Maintain</color></b>\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Drop Cost Multiplier: 1.02</color></b>",
